    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Mixed modeI-III loading is imposed on brittle material. The resulting cracks are compared qualitatively both to fringe joints observed in the field and to the theoretical predictions developed by Pollard and others (1982). The change in propagation angle is a function of klll/kl. When KIII=), B=0°,\r\nkIII=O, B=0°, klll<O, ~<0 and when kIII> >kI, B->\r\n45°.",
